{"entryType":"UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)","primaryAccession":"Q96FX8","secondaryAccessions":["B2RB73","E1P590","Q8IWS3","Q8N1J6","Q8NC16","Q9H1C5","Q9H230"],"uniProtkbId":"PERP_HUMAN","entryAudit":{"firstPublicDate":"2006-03-07","lastAnnotationUpdateDate":"2026-01-28","lastSequenceUpdateDate":"2001-12-01","entryVersion":166,"sequenceVersion":1},"annotationScore":5.0,"organism":{"scientificName":"Homo sapiens","commonName":"Human","taxonId":9606,"lineage":["Eukaryota","Metazoa","Chordata","Craniata","Vertebrata","Euteleostomi","Mammalia","Eutheria","Euarchontoglires","Primates","Haplorrhini","Catarrhini","Hominidae","Homo"]},"proteinExistence":"1: Evidence at protein level","proteinDescription":{"recommendedName":{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000312","source":"HGNC","id":"HGNC:17637"}],"value":"p53 apoptosis effector related to PMP-22"}},"alternativeNames":[{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"12752121"}],"value":"Keratinocyte-associated protein 1"},"shortNames":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"12752121"}],"value":"KCP-1"}]},{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"Reference","id":"Ref.3"}],"value":"P53-induced protein PIGPC1"}},{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"11062687"}],"value":"Transmembrane protein THW"}}]},"genes":[{"geneName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000312","source":"HGNC","id":"HGNC:17637"}],"value":"PERP"},"synonyms":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"12752121"}],"value":"KCP1"},{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"12752121"}],"value":"KRTCAP1"},{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"Reference","id":"Ref.3"}],"value":"PIGPC1"},{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"11062687"}],"value":"THW"}]}],"comments":[{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000250","source":"UniProtKB","id":"E9QHT9"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000250","source":"UniProtKB","id":"Q9JK95"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"25486861"}],"value":"Component of intercellular desmosome junctions (By similarity). Plays a role in stratified epithelial integrity and cell-cell adhesion by promoting desmosome assembly (By similarity). Thereby plays a role in barrier function of the skin against infection (By similarity). Plays a role in mammary epithelial tissue homeostasis and remodeling during and after pregnancy, potentially via its involvement in desmosome cell-cell junctions (By similarity). Required for tooth enamel development via facilitating desmosome-mediated ameloblast adhesion to the stratum intermedium during the transitional stage of amelogenesis (By similarity). May also play a role in downstream transcriptional regulation of other genes involved in amelogenesis such as AMBN, ENAM, MMP20 and KLK4 (By similarity). Plays a role as an effector in the TP53-dependent apoptotic pathway (By similarity). Positively regulates apoptosis in T-helper 17 (Th17) cell populations via caspase-dependent signaling (By similarity). Promotes neutrophil transepithelial migration in response to chemoattractants such as hepoxilin A3 (HXA3), N-Formylmethionyl-leucyl-phenylalanine (fMLP) and CXCL8/IL-8 (PubMed:25486861). Required for neutrophil transepithelial migration in response to S.typhimurium infection (PubMed:25486861). May act as a positive regulator of endothelial cell apoptosis in response to blood flow-derived shear stress (By similarity)"}],"commentType":"FUNCTION"},{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"25486861"}],"value":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with S.typhimurium sipA and sctB1/sipC"}],"commentType":"SUBUNIT"},{"commentType":"INTERACTION","interactions":[{"interactantOne":{"uniProtKBAccession":"Q96FX8","intActId":"EBI-17183069"},"interactantTwo":{"uniProtKBAccession":"O95870","geneName":"ABHD16A","i